policy={'status':'PROPOSED_ONLY_NOT_ACTIVE','confirmed_by_author_via_parent':{'contract':'unique_indefinite_for_new_contracts','notice_calendar_days':15,'notice_both_parties':True,'trial_months_maximum':3,'trial_renewal':False,'ordinary_severance_initiator':'employer_only','ordinary_severance_threshold':'at_least_one_year_at_effective_end_including_ordinary_notice','ordinary_severance_base':'total_recognized_seniority_when_threshold_reached','months_salary_per_year':0.20,'cap_months':6,'old_contracts':'protect_pre_effective_seniority_component; new_rate_for_post_effective_component; cap_only_new_component'},'editorial_choices_requiring_root_review':['For old contracts, retain prior eight-month opening condition while protecting old component.','Keep existing serious-misconduct exclusion of ordinary severance pending express contrary author decision; new fifteen-day notice remains payable.','Do not prolong trial: employer ends work at trial expiry and pays any notice balance; continuation beyond trial requires ordinary termination regime.','Do not erase specific retirement, consensual-termination or inaptitude indemnities by importing the ordinary one-year threshold.','Force majeure is retained as external event, distinguished from termination at a party initiative.','Retain legally specific waivers pending explicit coordination by root, including pregnancy and education of a child.'],'integration':'Forty-five sources with exact source/draft guards. Parent integrates after review; never run registration from this authoring file.'}
(HERE/'policy.proposed.json').write_text(json.dumps(policy,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Validated proposed core:',len(rows),'articles;',sum('previous_draft' in s for s in S),'existing-draft guards; no active writes')
